{"id": "3326603", "name": "אינטגרל משולש בסדר dz dy dx – גבולות תלויים, חישוב מדורג", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "none", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 2, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>יהי</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(\\displaystyle E= \\left\\{ (x,y,z): 0\\le x\\le{{CT:0}},\\ 0\\le y\\le{{CT:1}},\\ 0\\le z\\le{{CT:2}} \\right\\} \\)</p><p>חשבו את האינטגרל המשולש</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(\\displaystyle I=\\iiint_E {{CT:3}}\\,dV \\)</p><p>נחשב בסדר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle dz\\,dy\\,dx\\)</span>. כתבו תחילה</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(\\displaystyle I= \\int_0^{{{CT:0}}} \\int_0^{c(x)} \\int_0^{d(y)} {{CT:3}}\\,dz\\,dy\\,dx \\)</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">א׳</span>הגבולות התלויים</div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\displaystyle c(x)=\\) [[input:ans1]] &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; \\(\\displaystyle d(y)=\\) [[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]] [[validation:ans2]]</div></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">ב׳</span>לאחר האינטגרציה לפי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(z\\)</span></div><p>נסמן את תוצאת האינטגרציה הפנימית ב־<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle J_1(x,y)\\)</span>:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(\\displaystyle J_1(x,y) = \\int_0^{d(y)} {{CT:3}}\\,dz \\)</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\displaystyle J_1(x,y)=\\) [[input:ans3]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans3]]</div></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">ג׳</span>לאחר האינטגרציה לפי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y\\)</span></div><p>כעת נסמן את תוצאת האינטגרציה השנייה ב־<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle J_2(x)\\)</span>:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(\\displaystyle J_2(x) = \\int_0^{c(x)} J_1(x,y)\\,dy \\)</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\displaystyle J_2(x)=\\) [[input:ans4]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans4]]</div></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">ד׳</span>האינטגרציה האחרונה</div><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(\\displaystyle I= \\int_0^{{{CT:0}}} J_2(x)\\,dx \\)</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\displaystyle I=\\) [[input:ans5]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans5]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> קוראים את הגבולות מהגדרת התחום, ומחשבים מבפנים החוצה: כל אינטגרציה היא של פולינום.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — הגבולות (סעיף א׳)</b><br><p>מהגדרת <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(E\\)</span>: הגבול העליון של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y\\)</span> תלוי ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\)</span>, והגבול העליון של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(z\\)</span> תלוי ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y\\)</span>:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ c(x)={{CT:1}},\\qquad d(y)={{CT:2}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — האינטגרל לפי z (סעיף ב׳)</b><br><p>נחשב בסדר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle dz\\,dy\\,dx\\)</span>; <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y\\)</span> קבועים בשלב זה:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(\\displaystyle J_1(x,y)=\\int_0^{y/{{CT:4}}}{{CT:3}}\\,dz={{CT:5}}\\)</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 3 — האינטגרל לפי y (סעיף ג׳)</b><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(\\displaystyle J_2(x)=\\int_0^{x/{{CT:6}}}J_1(x,y)\\,dy={{CT:7}}\\)</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 4 — האינטגרל לפי x (סעיף ד׳)</b><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(\\displaystyle I=\\int_0^{{{CT:0}}}J_2(x)\\,dx={{CT:8}}\\)</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">[[feedback:prt1]] [[feedback:prt2]] [[feedback:prt3]] [[feedback:prt4]] [[feedback:prt5]]<span style=\"position: absolute; left: -10000px; top: auto; width: 1px; height: 1px; overflow: hidden; white-space: nowrap;\" aria-hidden=\"true\"> [[feedback:prt6]] [[feedback:prt7]] [[feedback:prt8]]</span></div>", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">חלק מן התשובה נכון. בדקו את שאר הרכיבים.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה עדיין אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 10, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 10, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 14, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans4", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 14, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 0, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans5", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 16, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 0, "synt